  "translation": "Na long wanem king i lukim wanpela man i lukaut wantaim wanpela holi man i kamdaun long heven, na i tok: Kapsaitim diwai, na bagarapim ⟨em⟩; tasol livim stamba wantaim ol rot bilong en long graun, hariapim ⟨em⟩ wantaim rop bilong ayan na kopa, long ol gras bilong garen; na wara bilong heven bai pulim ⟨em⟩, na hap bilong em bai i stap wantaim ol animal bilong garen, inap seven taim i go pinis long em.",
